<title>ALGERIA: Algerian food distributor makes $5.3 mln profit.</title>
<headline>Algerian food distributor makes $5.3 mln profit.</headline>
<dateline>ALGIERS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian food distributor Eriad Constantine made a profit of 292.9 million dinars ($5.3 million) in 1995, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Monday.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>Eriad Constantine had a turnover of 15.1 billion dinars in the year, the agency said, adding that a total of 97.5 million dinars of the profit would go to the company's workforce.</p>
<p>($1 = 55 dinars)</p>
</text>
